Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:07.15,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,How pitiful, new Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:10.24,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm vanishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.49,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:15.66,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.51,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,He's been swallowed up by the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.93,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:40.10,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,The voices of us Ring Princesses were \Nunable to reach that man on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:44.61,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,We were always stuck \Njust watching him from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:49.70,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Our destiny hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.99,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I have faith in Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.00,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.33,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,He's returned to the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.71,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,He won't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:08.05,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Also, now that the Ring King is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:10.72,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,this world will eventually \Nreturn to the Abyss as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:12.47,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:17.10,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I can still feel the power of the Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.02,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,We're still connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto hasn't completely vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.40,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,If I follow this flow of power...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:28.65,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,and reach out to him,\N then I can still make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:31.53,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Don't! If you do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:34.16,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,then you'll be swallowed by the Abyss with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:35.87,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I'm going anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:39.16,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:43.92,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,But Haruto still leapt in\Nto save me back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:46.13,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,which is why I'm here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:01:55.30,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,We weren't able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:59.22,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,All we could was watch as that man changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:01.68,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,We could only respond when he desired us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:04.35,Flashback,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:05.81,Flashback,RingKing,0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:09.19,Flashback,RingKing,0,0,0,,I don't need any more power from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:16.32,Flashback,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:21.62,Flashback,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,If nobody else,\N I'll stay with you until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:30.42,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,If I had reached out to him \Na little more back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:36.93,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's our fault that he became \Na monster drowning in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:40.30,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,We knew about his loneliness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:44.85,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,but in our desire for him to be strong,\Nwe pushed him away instead of acknowledging it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:49.40,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Yet you all...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.44,DefaultItalics,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,are able to leap after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:24.60,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,What's that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.39,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:33.65,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,I have to seize that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.54,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.25,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:12.94,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I came to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:21.49,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,I know you were swallowed by the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:24.08,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,So why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:25.91,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:28.25,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Because I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:33.59,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,You can only grant power,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:36.46,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,and you stepped into the Abyss yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.42,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:43.93,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Are you that reckless because \Nyou don't know how this world works?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:47.02,Default,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Return to the Abyss alongside him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:58.82,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto taught me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:02.20,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,that if you don't take a leap of faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.07,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,you'll never seize the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.54,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,It might be impossible by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.46,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,but I can do anything \Nwith Haruto at my side. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.25,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto, lend me your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:15.63,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:36.86,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.65,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's go, Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.91,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,Believe in her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:53.62,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,To move forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:04.80,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:06.14,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:17.36,DefaultItalics,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,Am I going to be defeated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:22.53,DefaultItalics,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,I defeated the Abyss \Nand held the power of the Ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:25.91,DefaultItalics,AbyssKing,0,0,0,,so how am I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:32.08,DefaultItalics,Ring,0,0,0,,The real nature of the light's power \Nisn't slaying evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:36.25,DefaultItalics,Ring,0,0,0,,It's the power to create, \Nnurture, and fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:40.09,DefaultItalics,Ring,0,0,0,,Power that we were unable to believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:46.68,DefaultItalics,Ring,0,0,0,,These young, earnest people \Nhave accomplished what we failed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.85,DefaultItalics,Ring,0,0,0,,Your time spent trapped in the Abyss is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.90,Default,RingKing,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:11.49,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,I may be an illusion you created,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:16.54,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,but I'm also the light born from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:19.79,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,You don't have to disappear into the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:25.51,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,This world and I both remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:30.97,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Your own light shall forgive and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.18,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,My fierce, sad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.56,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:09.38,Default,Sluder,0,0,0,,The monsters are vanishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.44,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:22.98,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I nearly lost again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:24.86,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I must have looked pretty lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:28.78,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,No, you were the coolest, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:35.58,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,You did well, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.67,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Satou! Krystal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:43.79,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:49.26,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Abyss King was defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.68,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,By our own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:55.43,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,No! Um, it's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:09:02.15,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Actually, I used up all my power, \Nand now I can hardly stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:03.73,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,That bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:07.28,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Well, it's not an issue \Nas long as you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:11.53,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,It's because everyone believed in Satou-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:12.91,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:16.15,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Satou-kun, you did very well yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:20.25,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,For us, and for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:22.62,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:27.50,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,The Abyss isn't completely gone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:30.34,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,The sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.47,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:36.43,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,But the Abyss King is already gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:41.85,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,What you defeated was nothing more \Nthan the Ring King who took in the Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:47.07,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,That's the actual source that \Nthe former Ring King challenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.69,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So it's the thing you fought?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:53.41,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,Though it's grown \Nfar stronger than it was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:58.74,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,The spirit of the former Ring King \Nboth nourished and chained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:02.41,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,That is the real ancient Abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.96,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,which has grown even deeper \Nsince it was last recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:17.93,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:20.47,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,We've come this far, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.23,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:29.19,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:31.40,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We can definitely win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.65,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem that way at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:37.16,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,The Abyss is the power \Nto return everything to nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:39.49,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,Light is the power to fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:42.91,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,If you convert all of your \Nmagic energy into light,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.92,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,you'll surely be able to fill up that Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:48.04,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:49.92,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,As you are right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:51.57,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I don't have enough power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:54.55,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.27,0:10:58.04,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I believe in all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:00.22,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So please, lend me your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:02.31,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:05.69,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:12.23,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Please let me support you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:13.69,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Marse-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:20.08,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Honestly, relying on others at the very end?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:28.13,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,All of my power is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:31.55,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,I'll protect the world of the Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:36.09,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,I'm not going to give up after coming this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:41.26,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,If even someone like me can be useful, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.10,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:48.02,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Link our powers together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:49.23,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.26,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:25.72,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:26.52,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:27.35,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:31.19,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We really did it, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:32.31,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.77,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.23,Default,Ring,0,0,0,,The Abyss is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:38.86,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:41.16,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:43.53,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,It's really over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.12,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.42,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.92,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You did a lot too, Hime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:00.76,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:04.85,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,It's not fair that only Krystal-sama gets that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:05.71,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:06.85,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:08.89,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,We all worked hard too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:09.60,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.73,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.11,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:16.19,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:18.86,Default,Sluder,0,0,0,,They actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:20.65,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.04,0:13:24.37,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Order the armies home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.45,Default,Sluder,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:38.96,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Good morning, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:45.89,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:52.56,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,You collapsed after that, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:57.15,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm relieved that you woke up \Nsooner than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:02.40,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,You pushed yourself even further \Nafter using up nearly all of your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:06.24,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,It must have caught up to you \Nonce you felt relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:11.50,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,Skin to skin contact is the best way \Nto recover your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:13.16,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:14.37,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:17.59,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:22.55,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm good, but if I had to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:25.72,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I think I'll be in incredible \Ntrouble if this keeps up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:27.60,Default,Catperson,0,0,0,,Ring King!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:29.68,Default,Catperson,0,0,0,,Pardon me for interrupting your fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:33.18,Default,Catperson,0,0,0,,The mobile caravans will\N arrive in Nokanatika soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:35.02,Default,Catperson,0,0,0,,Please start getting ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:36.65,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,In Nokanatika?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.82,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,I'm glad you woke up in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:41.36,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:51.54,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:54.54,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Oh, you look quite good in that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.37,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:58.30,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.34,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I-I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:01.97,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:04.68,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,They all want to see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:07.22,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,the man who saved the world, not the Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.36,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,You've saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:22.61,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,You can be proud of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:33.23,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We only won thanks to everyone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:35.96,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:42.05,Default,Nokanatikan,0,0,0,,Kiss her! Kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:42.05,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:45.17,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Go on, show off a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:57.67,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.19,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,You're still fatigued, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:02.95,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Then maybe I should kiss him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:04.03,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:07.03,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,No, this is mental exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:09.37,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:11.74,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Jade-san! Elder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:15.57,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,Nefritis always feared leaving the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:18.29,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,but now she's achieved so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:21.58,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,This was all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:23.55,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.59,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,However, now that \Nyou've accomplished your duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:29.60,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,did you want to return to our homeland
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:35.14,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,and go back to your \Npeaceful life with your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:35.93,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:38.52,Default,Jade,0,0,0,,Nefritis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:42.48,Default,Peridot,0,0,0,,So the key to victory was that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.23,Default,Peridot,0,0,0,,What was it like, \Ndoing it with the Ring King?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:47.11,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.07,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,What was it like...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:51.32,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I can't say!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:59.04,Default,Smaragdi,0,0,0,,The secret flavor is Smaragdi's special spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:01.12,Default,Smaragdi,0,0,0,,If all goes well, you'll be rock solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:05.46,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,Oh! So this is the lost technology \Nof the dwarves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:07.26,Default,Noble,0,0,0,,How marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:10.30,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Granart! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.26,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,You landed the best husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:17.52,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,The man who defeated the Abyss King \Nis a strong man worthy of Needakitta!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:20.60,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,H-He's not that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:24.56,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,I have more physical strength, \Nand he's unreliable in a lot of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:31.70,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,You've fallen for him, Grameowt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:34.78,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll get to see \Nsome grandchildren soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:36.74,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:40.21,Default,King,0,0,0,,You've grown so much, Saphir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:43.04,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:46.67,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,I was able to make it home\N in one piece, thankfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:49.22,Default,King,0,0,0,,I believe you're a good daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:53.13,Default,King,0,0,0,,but you can be a little cynical \Nat times, so I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.22,Default,Saphira,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:57.51,Default,Saphira,0,0,0,,My sister is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:17:59.14,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:03.52,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, \Nwe were able to seize the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:05.54,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,I'm truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:12.53,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,To be honest, \NI wrote you off as a rosy-eyed man
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:15.99,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,chasing after dusty legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:22.91,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,And I thought you were a man who had \Nlost hope after his dreams were crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:27.38,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,It seems we had both misjudged each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:32.80,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's because we both kept \Ngoing down the paths we believed in
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:34.68,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,that we're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:38.33,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The battle against the Abyss King is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:43.43,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,but will the end of battle \Nbring true peace to the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:47.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Will it revert to a chaotic world \Nwhere man fights man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:51.78,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It all rests on the shoulders of those \Nyoung men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:57.43,Default,PrimeMinister,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me, Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:01.74,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:07.96,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,It feels like the important people \Nat the castle don't trust me very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:13.63,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,With the Abyss King gone,\N the power you wield is immense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.30,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,You can't blame them for being cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:18.80,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.31,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,You'll become the \NKing of Nokanatika, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:23.43,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,What about the other Ring nations?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:26.67,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,You're the king of all of them, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:29.65,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I see. I can't even imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:33.82,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry too much \Nabout the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:36.40,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,You should just stand proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:41.16,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Haruto?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:47.04,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,It's true that we defeated the Abyss King,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:55.38,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,but do I really possess the judgment \Nto handle power this great?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:59.59,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,If I hold on to this great power,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.72,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,then people will think I'm dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:19.28,Default,Sluder,0,0,0,,Would you please reconsider, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.99,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's rare for you to speak against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:23.91,Default,Sluder,0,0,0,,He saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:27.08,Default,Sluder,0,0,0,,He only has great deeds \Nto his name, not crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.12,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:32.21,DefaultTop,Emperor,0,0,0,,However, the Ring is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:35.59,DefaultTop,Emperor,0,0,0,,Its existence will be a blight on the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.07,0:20:38.93,DefaultTop,Assassin,0,0,0,,Your Imperial Majesty,\NI bring terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:41.89,DefaultTop,Emperor,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.06,DefaultTop,Assassin,0,0,0,,I must humbly inform you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.95,0:20:49.31,DefaultTop,Assassin,0,0,0,,that the Ring King and\Nthe Ring Princesses have vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H6B5422&\3c&H938452&\bord3\b0\fs20}We're leaving this world for a while \Nto enjoy our honeymoon.\N- The Ring King and His Princesses
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:58.49,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H6B5422&\3c&HD5E1D1&\bord3\fs20\t(3526,5484,1 \c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}We're leaving this world for a while \Nto enjoy our honeymoon.\N- The Ring King and His Princesses
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:06.20,Default,All,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:10.29,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,TRANSLATOR: JOHN PICKETT
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:10.12,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of going \Nto the local art museum today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:11.92,Default,Amber,0,0,0,,I'll accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:15.63,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,I'll be making the rounds \Nto see the friends I made before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:15.50,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,TIMER: KRZYSZTOF KUNC\NEDITOR: ZACHARY CARLYSLE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:18.88,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,QC: WILLIAM HAGGARD\NFQC: SRIRAM GURUNATHAN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:18.88,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,I'm going to laze about and watch some TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:23.30,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Everyone's accustomed to living here \Nafter coming to this world once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:29.73,DefaultTop,Satou,0,0,0,,I feel kind of guilty that this is \Nhow our honeymoon turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:31.69,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:34.23,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Another world is way better \Nthan a foreign country!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:38.48,DefaultTop,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Experiences like this are precious, \Nso I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:43.20,DefaultTop,Saphir,0,0,0,,Being able to spend time without worrying \Nabout anyone else is novel and nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:44.74,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:46.66,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:49.16,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Yoohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:52.08,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Satou-kun! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:56.09,DefaultTop,Alabaster,0,0,0,,I figured you were settled in by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.09,0:21:57.63,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,So many books...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:59.46,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Are these history books?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:03.81,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,They're about the cultures of \Nvarious regions, and some on laws too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.81,0:22:06.05,Default,Saphir,0,0,0,,Why did you bring these?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:09.14,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,For me to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:10.60,Default,All,0,0,0,,Study?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:12.39,DefaultTop,Satou,0,0,0,,Even if I have power,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.39,0:22:16.69,DefaultTop,Satou,0,0,0,,people can't trust someone if they have \Nno idea what he's thinking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.69,0:22:19.65,DefaultTop,Satou,0,0,0,,So I figured I would start \Nby putting in the effort
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:22.82,DefaultTop,Satou,0,0,0,,to learn about Arnulus \Nso I can get them to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:26.36,DefaultTop,Satou,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll face the same issues \Nas the last Ring King, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.41,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,You're so great, Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:30.16,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,That's a noble attitude to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:32.62,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Well said, Satou-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:39.50,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:42.34,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,We're having a sukiyaki party tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:44.43,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone will be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:45.47,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.69,0:22:50.81,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,You know, I'm glad we came back \Nto this world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.14,0:22:51.93,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:59.44,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Because the ten years that we spent here \Nwere a special time for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:05.53,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true!

